1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 44=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:42,310 --> 00:01:42,840
Keep looking.

7
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:43,840
Check over there.

8
00:01:44,590 --> 00:01:45,400
Nothing here.

9
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,950
I'm just an innocent passerby.

10
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:49,200
We're the victims
whose lives are at stake.

11
00:01:50,408 --> 00:01:51,920
Those bandits kill without hesitation.

12
00:01:52,230 --> 00:01:53,680
We won't put your life at risk.

13
00:01:54,184 --> 00:01:55,070
We'll part ways here.

14
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,488
May our paths never cross again.

15
00:01:57,150 --> 00:01:57,590
Young Lady,

16
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,280
you can't outrun those bandits.

17
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,680
If you trust me,

18
00:02:02,870 --> 00:02:04,560
there's a little-known path here.

19
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,680
You should hide behind the reeds.

20
00:02:07,048 --> 00:02:08,310
I'll draw the bandits away.

21
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:09,780
- Nothing.
- Nothing here.

22
00:02:09,780 --> 00:02:10,700
Nothing here.

23
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:15,630
I trust you.

24
00:02:16,824 --> 00:02:18,430
His dagger was made by the government.

25
00:02:18,632 --> 00:02:19,150
Let's go.

26
00:02:19,150 --> 00:02:19,870
Over there.

27
00:02:30,750 --> 00:02:31,470
Help!

28
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,240
Murder!

29
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:32,710
Shut up!

30
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:33,910
Help! Murder!

31
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,960
Sir, don't be alarmed.

32
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,710
We're merchants from southern Fujian.

33
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,750
They're guards we hired.

34
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,280
They only look intimidating.

35
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:48,080
My brother and I came to Jinling

36
00:02:48,168 --> 00:02:49,208
but didn't make any money.

37
00:02:49,210 --> 00:02:51,240
To save on expenses,
we're spending the night here.

38
00:02:51,512 --> 00:02:52,800
But the cook traveling with us

39
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:54,240
stole our money and ran away.

40
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:55,470
Sir,

41
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,190
did you happen to see two women?

42
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,630
I've read so much

43
00:03:00,664 --> 00:03:02,216
that my eyesight has grown poor.

44
00:03:03,590 --> 00:03:04,960
I did see someone just now

45
00:03:05,430 --> 00:03:06,630
heading that way,

46
00:03:07,192 --> 00:03:08,910
but I couldn't make out their appearance

47
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,664
or tell whether it was a man or a woman.

48
00:03:13,030 --> 00:03:14,150
Thank you, sir.

49
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:20,400
There's no need to rush.

50
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,504
My cousin is the magistrate
of Shangyuan County.

51
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:23,590
My cousin and I

52
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,710
arranged to meet today

53
00:03:24,710 --> 00:03:25,910
at Bali Pavilion nearby.

54
00:03:26,008 --> 00:03:27,390
That fire was quite bright just now.

55
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,460
My cousin must have seen it.

56
00:03:28,470 --> 00:03:30,870
He'll surely bring
the constables with him to meet me.

57
00:03:31,128 --> 00:03:31,800
When he arrives,

58
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:33,330
he'll certainly be able to help you

59
00:03:33,496 --> 00:03:35,520
bring those two
female thieves to justice.

60
00:03:42,870 --> 00:03:44,280
Every word I've said is true.

61
00:03:44,910 --> 00:03:45,910
I haven't lied to you.

62
00:03:48,150 --> 00:03:49,280
If you two don't believe me,

63
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,280
why not sit down

64
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:53,800
and wait here for a while?

65
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:57,630
Money is only a worldly possession.

66
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:58,800
It comes and goes.

67
00:03:58,952 --> 00:04:00,360
There's no need to dwell on it.

68
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,880
The moon
is especially beautiful tonight.

69
00:04:04,536 --> 00:04:06,080
It shines upon past and present alike.

70
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:08,750
Gentlemen,

71
00:04:09,432 --> 00:04:11,208
we shouldn't let
such a night go to waste.

72
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:20,040
We still need to pack our belongings

73
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,496
and hurry back to southern Fujian,

74
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:23,430
so we won't disturb your enjoyment, sir.

75
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:44,720
Second Chief,

76
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:47,120
why aren't we going
after those two weavers?

77
00:04:48,510 --> 00:04:49,630
No, Second Young Master.

78
00:04:51,992 --> 00:04:54,300
Young Master said the weavers
are as insignificant as ants.

79
00:04:54,310 --> 00:04:55,430
They don't matter.

80
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:58,600
But that pedantic scholar is
from the Xie family of Jinling.

81
00:04:58,888 --> 00:05:01,390
If we kill him now, we'll draw
the attention of the authorities

82
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:03,120
and Jinling's prominent families.

83
00:05:03,256 --> 00:05:04,712
That would put us at a disadvantage.

84
00:05:06,408 --> 00:05:08,696
Leave no loose ends.
Get out of here as soon as possible.

85
00:05:08,750 --> 00:05:09,750
Leave no trace.

86
00:05:10,270 --> 00:05:11,030
- Yes.
- Yes.

87
00:05:11,310 --> 00:05:11,720
Hurry.

88
00:05:15,416 --> 00:05:16,970
The ones in the back, move it. Keep up.

89
00:05:17,630 --> 00:05:18,160
Move out.

90
00:05:28,830 --> 00:05:29,800
Clean and precise.

91
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,830
Killed with a single strike.

92
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,600
The killer was highly experienced,

93
00:05:34,632 --> 00:05:36,248
and someone accustomed to killing.

94
00:05:43,352 --> 00:05:44,680
Why would someone so experienced

95
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,120
kill a coachman

96
00:05:47,310 --> 00:05:48,190
just

97
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,390
to abduct two weavers?

98
00:05:51,112 --> 00:05:52,648
An enemy of yours, Your Lordship?

99
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:57,310
If this were an enemy of Jinqi's,

100
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:58,950
why go out of their way

101
00:05:58,950 --> 00:05:59,950
to abduct Xiuwan?

102
00:06:00,216 --> 00:06:01,600
They should have gone after Lanxiang

103
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:02,870
or Zhangcheng instead.

104
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:10,800
The kidnappers

105
00:06:11,310 --> 00:06:12,950
don't know Xiuwan's true identity.

106
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,310
If they did,

107
00:06:14,648 --> 00:06:16,560
they would never
have left the coachman's body

108
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,310
lying carelessly in the woods.

109
00:06:18,568 --> 00:06:21,256
The kidnappers must have assumed
they were two ordinary weavers.

110
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,680
Even if they went missing,

111
00:06:22,744 --> 00:06:24,472
the authorities
wouldn't take it seriously.

112
00:06:24,824 --> 00:06:27,048
They would only send ordinary constables
to investigate.

113
00:06:28,630 --> 00:06:30,360
The wound on his neck alone

114
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:33,000
doesn't reveal much either.

115
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,960
You already know who
the kidnappers are, Your Lordship.

116
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,070
More than half a month ago,

117
00:06:42,248 --> 00:06:44,830
the Longjiang Garrison was
escorting tribute goods to the capital

118
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:47,544
when they encountered river bandits
on a tributary of the canal.

119
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,630
Everyone

120
00:06:49,750 --> 00:06:51,040
aboard was killed.

121
00:06:51,368 --> 00:06:52,630
Their wounds were similar?

122
00:06:57,608 --> 00:06:59,870
I heard those river bandits
were exceptionally brutal.

123
00:07:00,750 --> 00:07:01,560
Xiuwan...

124
00:07:02,750 --> 00:07:03,560
Xiuwan...

125
00:07:12,580 --> 00:07:15,740
(Zezhi Workshop)

126
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,560
We're finally back safe and sound.

127
00:07:28,216 --> 00:07:29,070
Second Young Lady.

128
00:07:29,630 --> 00:07:30,160
Come here.

129
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:33,430
Second Young Lady,

130
00:07:33,736 --> 00:07:34,680
we mustn't tell anyone

131
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:36,000
about what happened to us.

132
00:07:36,070 --> 00:07:38,808
Why? I was thinking we could
go report it to the authorities later

133
00:07:38,824 --> 00:07:40,230
and have the kidnappers arrested.

134
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:42,590
No, we can't. My husband
and mother-in-law already disapprove

135
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,810
of me working outside the home.

136
00:07:43,820 --> 00:07:44,750
They say I'm never home.

137
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,510
If they find out
I was abducted by bandits

138
00:07:46,510 --> 00:07:48,580
and didn't come home all night,
they'll surely think

139
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,830
I've been dishonored.

140
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:54,430
Then the neighbors will gossip

141
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,600
and call me an indecent woman.

142
00:07:57,992 --> 00:07:59,864
I can put up
with what they say about me.

143
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:02,630
After all, I've spent my whole life
being looked down on.

144
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:09,680
But my daughter
will soon be discussing marriage.

145
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:12,040
I can't let this ruin her reputation.

146
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,830
Please take my advice, all right?

147
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:19,070
I'm sure
your mother would rather suffer herself

148
00:08:20,070 --> 00:08:21,750
than let you become
the subject of gossip

149
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:23,096
and have your reputation ruined.

150
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:28,480
Those kidnappers
were clearly the ones who did wrong.

151
00:08:28,936 --> 00:08:31,070
Why should we be
the ones ashamed to face others?

152
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,840
Because we're women.

153
00:08:37,790 --> 00:08:39,360
We were born to suffer.

154
00:08:50,136 --> 00:08:52,680
No wonder Gantang always
says it's hard to recruit workers.

155
00:08:53,910 --> 00:08:55,080
I never understood

156
00:08:55,870 --> 00:08:57,150
why those women

157
00:08:58,200 --> 00:09:00,600
would rather humble themselves
and ask men for money

158
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,840
than go out and earn their own living.

159
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:06,080
I thought they simply lacked ambition.

160
00:09:07,864 --> 00:09:09,496
It turns out it's simply because...

161
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,200
we're women.

162
00:09:25,510 --> 00:09:26,320
Xiuwan.

163
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:28,510
Madam.

164
00:09:31,020 --> 00:09:31,940
Lanxiang.

165
00:09:39,384 --> 00:09:40,240
It's all right now.

166
00:09:49,176 --> 00:09:51,360
Go back to work
at Zezhi Workshop without worry.

167
00:09:51,670 --> 00:09:53,270
I already told Gantang yesterday

168
00:09:53,670 --> 00:09:55,840
to keep this quiet
and carry on as usual.

169
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:58,480
If anyone asks about last night,

170
00:09:58,600 --> 00:09:59,440
just say

171
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,720
Madam wanted to inspect the new loom,

172
00:10:01,910 --> 00:10:04,600
so the Second Young Lady
took you straight to the Lin Residence.

173
00:10:04,790 --> 00:10:06,790
You accidentally missed the curfew,

174
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,320
so you and Shopkeeper Zhou

175
00:10:08,550 --> 00:10:10,200
spent the night at the residence.

176
00:10:10,984 --> 00:10:12,320
You're so compassionate, Madam.

177
00:10:12,750 --> 00:10:13,550
Thank you very much.

178
00:10:13,992 --> 00:10:15,910
I went to the residence
to report back yesterday

179
00:10:16,030 --> 00:10:17,670
and missed the curfew,

180
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,840
so I stayed there overnight.

181
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,390
You were with me.

182
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:39,440
Are you still thinking
about what Lady Peng said?

183
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:43,240
If a man encounters criminals

184
00:10:43,352 --> 00:10:44,870
and manages to escape with his life,

185
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:47,510
everyone would be happy for him.

186
00:10:49,030 --> 00:10:50,120
But for women,

187
00:10:53,848 --> 00:10:56,240
it's as if we're
the ones who've done something wrong,

188
00:10:56,630 --> 00:10:58,150
terrified that anyone might find out.

189
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,630
When a man brings money home,

190
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:04,840
everyone praises him as
a good husband and father.

191
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:08,240
When a woman works hard
and brings money home,

192
00:11:08,790 --> 00:11:10,320
not only does no one praise her,

193
00:11:10,390 --> 00:11:12,000
but people also gossip about her.

194
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:15,390
What infuriates me most is

195
00:11:15,750 --> 00:11:17,750
that it's bad enough
for men to think that way,

196
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:20,270
but even women themselves believe it,

197
00:11:21,016 --> 00:11:22,750
thinking that showing themselves
in public

198
00:11:22,910 --> 00:11:24,150
and working to earn money

199
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:26,320
makes them inferior.

200
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:35,990
If a gentleman wishes to enlighten
the people and improve their customs,

201
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,440
he must begin with education.

202
00:11:38,870 --> 00:11:40,630
Women aren't ignorant or foolish.

203
00:11:42,150 --> 00:11:43,750
No one has simply ever told them

204
00:11:44,630 --> 00:11:45,840
that going out to earn money

205
00:11:46,270 --> 00:11:47,840
and supporting themselves

206
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:50,240
is nothing to be ashamed of.

207
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,200
That makes sense.

208
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:00,720
Jade left uncarved

209
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:02,600
cannot become a useful vessel.

210
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,840
A person without learning

211
00:12:05,510 --> 00:12:06,440
cannot know the way.

212
00:12:09,910 --> 00:12:11,440
But that's simply the world we live in.

213
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:18,270
Lanxiang, you want to become

214
00:12:18,790 --> 00:12:20,550
a teacher who enlightens women?

215
00:12:22,790 --> 00:12:23,840
It's not just me.

216
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:25,630
There's also you.

217
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:27,000
Me?

218
00:12:28,750 --> 00:12:30,390
You defied what others might think

219
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,840
and went to work at Zezhi Workshop,

220
00:12:32,630 --> 00:12:34,000
earning your own living.

221
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:37,550
That's teaching by example.

222
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:41,270
Gantang even said

223
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:43,000
that since you joined Zezhi Workshop,

224
00:12:43,270 --> 00:12:44,510
the women there

225
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:46,870
have been laughing
and talking more than ever.

226
00:12:48,030 --> 00:12:48,840
I...

227
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:50,440
I just talk a lot,

228
00:12:50,750 --> 00:12:52,440
and I haven't had much schooling.

229
00:12:52,630 --> 00:12:54,870
How could I ever teach others the way?

230
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:00,030
The scriptures say,

231
00:13:00,750 --> 00:13:03,000
"From one lamp, many lamps are lit,

232
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:05,840
until ten thousand lamps shine bright."

233
00:13:07,160 --> 00:13:08,390
From one lamp,

234
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:10,480
many lamps are lit,

235
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,000
until ten thousand lamps shine bright.

236
00:13:16,270 --> 00:13:17,784
The light of a single lamp is faint

237
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:20,200
and can illuminate only a small space.

238
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,630
But if I light one lamp,

239
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,720
and you light another,

240
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:28,150
and Yuchan, Gantang, Baogai, Xiaolian,

241
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:30,360
Furong, Ji'er, and the others

242
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:31,440
each light one, too,

243
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,510
then even the faint glow of fireflies,

244
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:36,360
when gathered together,

245
00:13:37,150 --> 00:13:39,030
can illuminate an entire street

246
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,870
and show women
traveling through the dark

247
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:44,000
the way forward.

248
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:48,940
♪Deep within the lights
lies a truth that came too late♪

249
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:50,480
And there's Mister Shen Rugu.

250
00:13:51,030 --> 00:13:52,510
Though he isn't a woman,

251
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:54,120
he helped light the way for us too,

252
00:13:54,510 --> 00:13:56,000
and his lamp shines especially bright.

253
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:57,750
It was after seeing a play he wrote

254
00:13:57,832 --> 00:13:59,992
that I resolved
to leave the confines of my home.

255
00:14:09,270 --> 00:14:10,840
I'm hungry.

256
00:14:13,550 --> 00:14:14,840
We'll eat when we get home.

257
00:14:20,670 --> 00:14:21,720
His Lordship is back.

258
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:25,790
Where's Xiuwan?

259
00:14:27,670 --> 00:14:30,120
Aunt Lingxiao took
her away in tears, of course.

260
00:14:47,790 --> 00:14:49,240
Old Coachman Yue was killed.

261
00:14:51,256 --> 00:14:52,840
I've already instructed Head Butler Yang

262
00:14:52,968 --> 00:14:54,840
to make proper arrangements
for his family.

263
00:14:59,832 --> 00:15:01,600
You must catch
the killer, Your Lordship.

264
00:15:02,550 --> 00:15:03,360
By the way,

265
00:15:04,328 --> 00:15:06,080
this is a clue about the kidnappers left

266
00:15:06,210 --> 00:15:07,768
by the righteous man who saved Xiuwan.

267
00:15:10,790 --> 00:15:12,870
What's his name? Where does he live?

268
00:15:13,272 --> 00:15:15,140
I'll visit him tomorrow
to thank him in person.

269
00:15:15,200 --> 00:15:16,240
Xiuwan said

270
00:15:16,370 --> 00:15:18,720
he left
after escorting them to the city gate.

271
00:15:19,592 --> 00:15:21,150
She didn't understand why at the time,

272
00:15:21,450 --> 00:15:22,840
but only realized afterward

273
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:26,270
that he must have guessed they
wouldn't report it to the authorities,

274
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:27,840
so he left this letter.

275
00:15:28,216 --> 00:15:30,408
He said it contained
portraits of the kidnappers.

276
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:33,120
They could be handed over
to the authorities or burned.

277
00:15:36,616 --> 00:15:38,870
There are plenty of people in this world
who blindly follow convention

278
00:15:38,870 --> 00:15:40,320
and seek fame under false pretenses.

279
00:15:41,510 --> 00:15:42,630
I never expected this man

280
00:15:43,016 --> 00:15:44,440
to be not only noble in character,

281
00:15:44,968 --> 00:15:46,510
but also open-minded and adaptable.

282
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:48,240
He truly is remarkable.

283
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:04,080
His brushwork is masterful,

284
00:16:04,472 --> 00:16:06,136
and his skill at drawing is exceptional.

285
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:09,440
I'll give the order now

286
00:16:09,500 --> 00:16:11,256
to post notices
for the criminals' arrest.

287
00:16:13,576 --> 00:16:15,336
If you let word
of Xiuwan's ordeal get out,

288
00:16:15,368 --> 00:16:17,390
Aunt Lingxiao
will surely go to the family shrine,

289
00:16:17,390 --> 00:16:19,990
bring out the instruments of
family punishment, and come after you.

290
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:22,670
I should have
explained it clearly to you.

291
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:26,240
It's them. They robbed
the tribute goods bound for the capital

292
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:27,600
and killed Commander Ding

293
00:16:27,670 --> 00:16:29,030
and every soldier aboard.

294
00:16:34,150 --> 00:16:36,910
No wonder they abducted
the weavers and stole the loom.

295
00:16:37,336 --> 00:16:39,256
They must be colluding
with an overseas kingdom

296
00:16:39,304 --> 00:16:41,150
that covets
our realm's weaving techniques.

297
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:43,120
You guessed right.

298
00:16:43,448 --> 00:16:44,648
They're not river bandits.

299
00:16:44,910 --> 00:16:46,080
They're pirates from the sea.

300
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:48,030
They usually hide out at sea.

301
00:16:49,030 --> 00:16:50,480
No wonder Jiugao and Nanke

302
00:16:50,550 --> 00:16:53,496
have been investigating for over
ten days without finding a single clue.

303
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,870
Why would pirates come to Jinling?

304
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:59,320
Even if they wanted to abduct weavers,

305
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:02,120
Songjiang Prefecture
is closer to the coast than Jinling.

306
00:17:04,550 --> 00:17:05,680
Bring them back.

307
00:17:05,912 --> 00:17:07,416
Once we interrogate them, we'll know.

308
00:17:18,860 --> 00:17:20,580
(Wanted)

309
00:17:20,590 --> 00:17:21,400
Come take a look!

310
00:17:21,590 --> 00:17:22,000
Look.

311
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:23,470
Anyone who reports their whereabouts

312
00:17:23,528 --> 00:17:25,060
will be rewarded twenty taels of silver.

313
00:17:25,070 --> 00:17:26,070
Twenty taels?

314
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:27,270
That's a lot.

315
00:17:28,550 --> 00:17:29,270
Twenty taels!

316
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:30,070
Let's go.

317
00:17:30,070 --> 00:17:31,640
The authorities have already
posted notices at the city gate,

318
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:33,030
offering a reward for our capture.

319
00:17:33,030 --> 00:17:33,620
(Wanted)

320
00:17:33,630 --> 00:17:34,270
Chief,

321
00:17:34,830 --> 00:17:36,400
we should hurry back out to sea.

322
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:51,400
Chief...

323
00:17:51,550 --> 00:17:53,030
No... Young Master!

324
00:17:53,030 --> 00:17:53,680
I was wrong.

325
00:17:53,750 --> 00:17:54,700
I won't do it again.

326
00:17:59,310 --> 00:18:00,750
Young Master, we were wrong.

327
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:01,790
We were wrong.

328
00:18:01,790 --> 00:18:02,830
We really were wrong.

329
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:04,310
It was our fault.

330
00:18:04,310 --> 00:18:05,440
It was all our fault.

331
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:06,510
We really were wrong.

332
00:18:08,350 --> 00:18:10,200
The authorities are looking for pirates.

333
00:18:11,550 --> 00:18:13,880
You're all respectable merchants
with clean records.

334
00:18:14,110 --> 00:18:15,270
What are you afraid of?

335
00:18:16,920 --> 00:18:17,350
Yes.

336
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,640
You're right, Young Master.

337
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:20,400
We're not afraid.

338
00:18:21,310 --> 00:18:21,790
Not afraid.

339
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:22,720
Get out, all of you.

340
00:18:22,856 --> 00:18:23,920
Thank you, Young Master.

341
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:27,200
You want to serve me?

342
00:19:30,310 --> 00:19:31,110
Yes.

343
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:06,310
Finish the job,

344
00:20:06,696 --> 00:20:08,550
and then clean yourself up
and come serve me.

345
00:20:21,830 --> 00:20:22,920
Xie Zhao,

346
00:20:25,880 --> 00:20:27,350
I underestimated you.

347
00:20:34,620 --> 00:20:41,740
(Wanted)

348
00:20:41,750 --> 00:20:43,550
Lin Jinqi.

349
00:20:44,030 --> 00:20:45,830
Xu Lanxiang.

350
00:20:48,110 --> 00:20:49,720
It's been sixteen years.

351
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:53,720
You don't even

352
00:20:55,350 --> 00:20:56,880
recognize me anymore.

353
00:21:02,580 --> 00:21:08,700
(Glorify the Family Name)

354
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:25,160
Xiuwan.

355
00:21:26,590 --> 00:21:27,680
Wrong.

356
00:21:28,830 --> 00:21:29,720
Xiushu.

357
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:32,960
Wrong again.

358
00:21:33,550 --> 00:21:34,480
Xiuru.

359
00:21:36,720 --> 00:21:38,240
Lanxiang, you're biased against me.

360
00:21:38,550 --> 00:21:40,480
Can't I laugh and joke around

361
00:21:40,590 --> 00:21:42,110
like Xiuwan and Xiushu?

362
00:21:43,790 --> 00:21:45,030
I was being unfair.

363
00:21:45,350 --> 00:21:46,510
Forgive me, Xiuru.

364
00:21:47,688 --> 00:21:49,310
What are you thinking about, Lanxiang?

365
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:50,720
You were so lost in thought

366
00:21:50,920 --> 00:21:52,510
you didn't even hear us come in.

367
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:55,920
In the letter left
by the righteous man who saved you,

368
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:57,720
he drew portraits of three pirates.

369
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:00,310
One of them had half his face covered.

370
00:22:00,680 --> 00:22:01,720
For some reason,

371
00:22:02,070 --> 00:22:03,240
I keep thinking about him.

372
00:22:03,368 --> 00:22:05,816
I feel as though
I've seen him somewhere before.

373
00:22:06,240 --> 00:22:07,480
But when I think carefully,

374
00:22:08,030 --> 00:22:10,240
I've never seen
a man who looks like him.

375
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:20,400
What about you, Xiuwan?

376
00:22:24,110 --> 00:22:27,160
Me? You know me.

377
00:22:27,720 --> 00:22:30,070
I can't even remember what the kidnapper

378
00:22:30,070 --> 00:22:31,640
who chased me with a knife looked like.

379
00:22:32,400 --> 00:22:33,310
Xiuwan,

380
00:22:33,550 --> 00:22:34,830
you're really no help at all.

381
00:22:35,208 --> 00:22:36,328
I was terrified at the time.

382
00:22:36,330 --> 00:22:38,580
I was so panicked.
All I could think about was escaping.

383
00:22:38,600 --> 00:22:40,568
How could I have stopped
to look at his face?

384
00:22:43,030 --> 00:22:44,030
Lanxiang,

385
00:22:44,400 --> 00:22:45,350
look at her.

386
00:22:45,790 --> 00:22:47,830
Xiuru is getting fiercer by the day.

387
00:22:47,896 --> 00:22:50,616
What happened to the sweet
and delicate girl she used to be?

388
00:22:55,110 --> 00:22:56,790
Xiuru is indeed more...

389
00:23:14,200 --> 00:23:15,000
Lanxiang?

390
00:23:17,030 --> 00:23:18,070
I remember

391
00:23:18,750 --> 00:23:19,880
who that man looks like.

392
00:23:22,720 --> 00:23:24,510
Xiuwan and I know him, too?

393
00:23:27,720 --> 00:23:29,000
Du Cuique.

394
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:36,030
Back then,

395
00:23:36,960 --> 00:23:38,590
Du Cuique was sentenced to exile...

396
00:23:38,920 --> 00:23:40,070
Qiongzhou...

397
00:23:40,640 --> 00:23:42,920
On the way to Qiongzhou,

398
00:23:43,032 --> 00:23:45,800
Du Cuique fell ill with malaria
after failing to adapt to the climate.

399
00:23:45,880 --> 00:23:47,110
Then she encountered bandits.

400
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:49,640
In the chaos, she failed to escape

401
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:51,240
and was killed.

402
00:23:52,200 --> 00:23:53,920
Du Cuique is cunning

403
00:23:53,960 --> 00:23:55,400
and skilled at manipulating people.

404
00:23:56,110 --> 00:23:58,200
Perhaps she wasn't
killed by the bandits at all,

405
00:23:58,408 --> 00:24:00,984
but instead seized the opportunity
to fake her death and escape.

406
00:24:01,310 --> 00:24:02,590
Lanxiang is right.

407
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:05,750
Du Cuique
may have had someone die in her place

408
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:07,720
and left with the bandits.

409
00:24:08,790 --> 00:24:10,160
But the pirate leader

410
00:24:10,960 --> 00:24:11,960
is a man.

411
00:24:14,590 --> 00:24:16,310
I had a vague feeling something was off,

412
00:24:16,360 --> 00:24:18,040
but no matter
how hard I thought about it,

413
00:24:18,070 --> 00:24:20,270
I couldn't recall any man
with a similar face.

414
00:24:20,360 --> 00:24:22,510
That's because
I was thinking in the wrong direction.

415
00:24:23,070 --> 00:24:24,350
I simply assumed

416
00:24:24,480 --> 00:24:26,960
that since the pirate
in the portrait was their leader,

417
00:24:27,310 --> 00:24:28,720
he must naturally be a man.

418
00:24:30,480 --> 00:24:33,030
I always say
we shouldn't underestimate women,

419
00:24:33,590 --> 00:24:35,550
yet I let my own assumptions

420
00:24:36,310 --> 00:24:37,400
blind me.

421
00:24:42,920 --> 00:24:43,750
Impossible.

422
00:24:46,550 --> 00:24:47,830
If it really was Du Cuique,

423
00:24:48,510 --> 00:24:50,160
why would she let me escape so easily?

424
00:24:50,830 --> 00:24:52,720
Du Cuique hasn't changed.

425
00:24:53,416 --> 00:24:56,264
She still treats servants and commoners
as if their lives mean nothing.

426
00:24:56,408 --> 00:24:57,680
She probably never even looked

427
00:24:57,680 --> 00:24:59,550
at the weavers they abducted.

428
00:25:08,110 --> 00:25:09,590
Whether it's Du Cuique or not,

429
00:25:10,110 --> 00:25:11,640
we need to tell His Lordship at once.

430
00:25:33,110 --> 00:25:33,920
It's her.

431
00:25:35,160 --> 00:25:36,160
It's Du Cuique.

432
00:25:37,400 --> 00:25:38,200
Xiuwan.

433
00:25:42,720 --> 00:25:44,240
Lanxiang and I have both confirmed it.

434
00:25:44,590 --> 00:25:46,000
Jinqi has seen Du Cuique, too.

435
00:25:46,550 --> 00:25:47,720
Once he confirms it,

436
00:25:47,880 --> 00:25:49,200
we can be absolutely certain.

437
00:25:51,590 --> 00:25:52,790
Other than Lanxiang,

438
00:25:53,960 --> 00:25:55,160
what woman's face

439
00:25:55,160 --> 00:25:57,048
could I possibly
remember for over ten years?

440
00:25:59,550 --> 00:26:01,720
I can't even remember now

441
00:26:01,864 --> 00:26:03,528
whether her eyes were big or small.

442
00:26:21,200 --> 00:26:21,960
Don't be afraid.

443
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:26,720
Even Xiuru has grown fierce now.

444
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:29,510
Even if Du Cuique
has come back from the dead,

445
00:26:30,350 --> 00:26:31,920
if we caught her once,

446
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:33,920
we can catch her again.

447
00:27:20,310 --> 00:27:21,550
It's Du Cuique.

448
00:27:22,830 --> 00:27:24,000
A pirate leader

449
00:27:24,504 --> 00:27:25,790
wouldn't leave her hideout at sea

450
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:27,960
and risk coming to Jinling

451
00:27:29,160 --> 00:27:30,640
just for the weavers.

452
00:27:31,464 --> 00:27:33,944
She must be here
to take revenge on Jinqi and Lanxiang.

453
00:27:40,790 --> 00:27:43,110
Let Lin Jinqi and Xu Lanxiang

454
00:27:44,640 --> 00:27:46,310
think I came to Jinling

455
00:27:46,960 --> 00:27:48,310
for revenge.

456
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:52,790
But then again,

457
00:27:53,830 --> 00:27:54,920
it's not entirely wrong.

458
00:27:56,440 --> 00:27:58,750
I do want them dead.

459
00:28:01,790 --> 00:28:02,720
My brother

460
00:28:04,240 --> 00:28:06,160
is still waiting in the underworld

461
00:28:07,310 --> 00:28:09,200
for them to answer for what they did.

462
00:28:12,380 --> 00:28:20,180
(Glorify the Family Name)

463
00:28:26,590 --> 00:28:28,550
I'll help you kill them.

464
00:28:36,480 --> 00:28:38,240
I once went to great lengths

465
00:28:39,200 --> 00:28:40,880
to marry into the Lin family.

466
00:28:45,960 --> 00:28:47,720
I really did choose well.

467
00:28:49,240 --> 00:28:50,880
I wasn't wrong about him at all.

468
00:28:54,510 --> 00:28:57,480
Lin Jinqi was indeed made
a marquis and granted a title.

469
00:29:00,920 --> 00:29:01,920
What a pity.

470
00:29:03,240 --> 00:29:04,440
I wasn't skilled enough

471
00:29:05,310 --> 00:29:06,640
and lost by a single move.

472
00:29:08,400 --> 00:29:09,400
Otherwise,

473
00:29:11,750 --> 00:29:12,790
by now,

474
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:17,030
I'd be the Marchioness
of Marquis Jing'an's Residence.

475
00:29:21,790 --> 00:29:23,480
Why is there still
no word from the north?

476
00:29:31,920 --> 00:29:34,070
Once you return
with news from the Zhejiang coast,

477
00:29:36,030 --> 00:29:38,030
there will be good news.

478
00:29:53,310 --> 00:29:55,440
Lin Jinqi.

479
00:30:06,270 --> 00:30:07,510
You're highly skilled in combat.

480
00:30:08,310 --> 00:30:09,830
Why would you commit such treason

481
00:30:10,310 --> 00:30:11,920
and kill a court official?

482
00:30:12,720 --> 00:30:14,070
On the Chief's orders,

483
00:30:14,536 --> 00:30:15,960
I've come to deliver you a letter!

484
00:30:27,512 --> 00:30:29,070
And take your head while I'm at it,

485
00:30:29,070 --> 00:30:30,110
as an offering to Du Zheng!

486
00:30:47,510 --> 00:30:48,270
Du Zheng.

487
00:31:04,680 --> 00:31:06,070
I'll hold them off.

488
00:31:06,664 --> 00:31:08,392
You hurry back
to Jinling and report this.

489
00:31:09,260 --> 00:31:11,480
(Ding Peng)
I'll hold them off. You should leave.

490
00:31:11,550 --> 00:31:12,550
That's an order.

491
00:31:19,440 --> 00:31:20,920
Du Zheng deserved to die.

492
00:31:26,480 --> 00:31:27,830
Even if I hadn't killed him,

493
00:31:28,920 --> 00:31:30,240
his crimes were unforgivable.

494
00:31:31,960 --> 00:31:32,960
Kill him!

495
00:31:44,350 --> 00:31:45,030
Ding Peng!

496
00:31:45,400 --> 00:31:46,160
Go!

497
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:49,640
Go!

498
00:31:49,640 --> 00:31:50,510
Hurry!

499
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:57,110
You have plundered the people

500
00:31:57,400 --> 00:31:58,830
and taken countless lives.

501
00:31:59,270 --> 00:32:00,830
By law, you must be executed.

502
00:35:51,960 --> 00:35:53,630
Urgent dispatch, 400 km!

503
00:35:54,190 --> 00:35:56,000
Urgent dispatch, 400 km!

504
00:35:57,190 --> 00:35:59,150
Urgent dispatch, 400 km!

505
00:35:59,820 --> 00:36:02,860
(Jinling Defense Command)

506
00:36:15,360 --> 00:36:17,528
His Majesty personally
led a campaign against Wona.

507
00:36:18,280 --> 00:36:19,480
After reaching Huailai,

508
00:36:20,070 --> 00:36:23,360
he was misled by Wang Yi, Chief
Eunuch of the Directorate of Ceremonial.

509
00:36:23,670 --> 00:36:25,510
Ignoring the objections of his generals,

510
00:36:26,030 --> 00:36:28,110
he ordered
the camp moved closer to the water.

511
00:36:28,710 --> 00:36:33,150
Wona forces charged
down from Yao'er Ridge.

512
00:36:40,000 --> 00:36:41,440
The imperial banners fell.

513
00:36:41,752 --> 00:36:44,408
The bodies of civil and
military officials covered the fields.

514
00:36:44,440 --> 00:36:45,320
His Majesty...

515
00:36:45,960 --> 00:36:48,630
His Majesty was captured by the enemy.

516
00:36:51,360 --> 00:36:52,400
That can't be!

517
00:36:52,488 --> 00:36:54,810
His Majesty marched out
with two hundred thousand troops!

518
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:57,224
How could these
tens of thousands of Wona soldiers...

519
00:36:58,670 --> 00:36:59,440
capture him?

520
00:37:00,550 --> 00:37:01,150
This...

521
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:03,880
What are we to do?

522
00:37:04,440 --> 00:37:07,670
What should we do now?

523
00:37:08,040 --> 00:37:09,624
It is now the end of the ninth month.

524
00:37:09,880 --> 00:37:11,280
His Majesty has been held captive

525
00:37:11,510 --> 00:37:12,710
for over a month.

526
00:37:13,400 --> 00:37:15,710
Your Grace, do you know
the situation in the capital?

527
00:37:16,232 --> 00:37:18,184
Has the Empress Dowager
issued any decree?

528
00:37:18,710 --> 00:37:21,710
The realm cannot
be without a ruler for even a day.

529
00:37:22,712 --> 00:37:24,550
After the terrible news
reached the capital,

530
00:37:24,920 --> 00:37:27,110
the Empress Dowager
accepted Han Liang's proposal

531
00:37:27,550 --> 00:37:29,670
and installed Prince Chen
as the new Emperor.

532
00:37:30,920 --> 00:37:31,840
Now, His Majesty

533
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:34,970
(His Majesty, formerly Prince Chen)
has successfully ascended the throne.

534
00:37:34,984 --> 00:37:37,400
Han Liang was appointed Minister of War.

535
00:37:39,030 --> 00:37:41,030
Minister Han has ordered

536
00:37:42,000 --> 00:37:44,190
troops from across
the realm to rush to the capital

537
00:37:44,440 --> 00:37:46,760
and join forces against the Wona army.

538
00:37:46,960 --> 00:37:49,070
The Jinling Defense Command
is hereby ordered

539
00:37:49,070 --> 00:37:50,960
to allocate bows,
crossbows, swords, and spears,

540
00:37:50,960 --> 00:37:53,160
one million two hundred sixty thousand
weapons in total,

541
00:37:53,192 --> 00:37:55,416
along with four hundred thousand shi
of provisions.

542
00:37:55,720 --> 00:37:58,400
The Longjiang Garrison shall
select two thousand elite soldiers

543
00:37:58,710 --> 00:38:00,590
to escort them to the capital.

544
00:38:01,920 --> 00:38:02,710
We obey.

545
00:38:03,550 --> 00:38:06,960
The Wona army is at
the gates of the capital.

546
00:38:07,150 --> 00:38:08,510
I ask all of you

547
00:38:08,590 --> 00:38:10,150
to stand together

548
00:38:10,480 --> 00:38:12,840
and resist the enemy.

549
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:13,800
- Yes.
- Yes.

550
00:38:23,230 --> 00:38:24,110
Mother.

551
00:38:26,840 --> 00:38:28,190
I want to give some to Father.

552
00:38:28,190 --> 00:38:29,440
Zhangrun, don't be naughty.

553
00:38:38,400 --> 00:38:38,880
Come.

554
00:38:59,070 --> 00:39:01,230
Zhangrun prepared
some Chinese yam cakes for you.

555
00:39:03,800 --> 00:39:04,590
Really?

556
00:39:16,400 --> 00:39:19,110
Thank you, Zhangrun, for the cakes.

557
00:39:20,190 --> 00:39:21,400
Thank you, Zhangcheng,

558
00:39:21,840 --> 00:39:23,230
for helping me pack.

559
00:39:29,630 --> 00:39:31,480
This is a protective charm I prayed for.

560
00:39:32,230 --> 00:39:35,280
My teacher said weapons
show no mercy on the battlefield.

561
00:39:35,670 --> 00:39:37,800
Father, you must be careful.

562
00:39:38,550 --> 00:39:40,030
You must come home safely.

563
00:39:45,360 --> 00:39:46,480
I'll remember that.

564
00:39:47,110 --> 00:39:48,550
I'll be sure to come home safely.

565
00:40:02,780 --> 00:40:04,660
(Blessing)

566
00:40:07,530 --> 00:40:10,530
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

567
00:40:11,660 --> 00:40:15,220
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

568
00:40:15,900 --> 00:40:18,720
♪Peace of heart in three places♪

569
00:40:19,620 --> 00:40:22,820
♪The years are calluses in our palms♪

570
00:40:23,960 --> 00:40:26,470
♪And the worries
etched between our brows♪

571
00:40:26,500 --> 00:40:27,230
It's very late.

572
00:40:27,630 --> 00:40:29,150
Zhangrun should go to bed.

573
00:40:29,320 --> 00:40:30,920
Otherwise, you won't grow tall.

574
00:40:31,960 --> 00:40:32,880
Go to bed now.

575
00:40:32,880 --> 00:40:35,560
♪While two pairs of eyes
watch from below♪

576
00:40:38,110 --> 00:40:41,740
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

577
00:40:43,360 --> 00:40:44,000
Go on.

578
00:40:46,500 --> 00:40:50,970
♪Four seasons
wax and wane, year after year♪

579
00:40:51,912 --> 00:40:53,230
It's dark and raining heavily.

580
00:40:53,630 --> 00:40:54,670
Take a few more lanterns.

581
00:40:55,110 --> 00:40:56,630
Watch your step. The road is slippery.

582
00:40:58,150 --> 00:40:58,710
Yes.

583
00:41:01,030 --> 00:41:01,590
Let's go.

584
00:41:03,140 --> 00:41:07,360
♪The journey home
always carries joy and sorrow♪

585
00:41:07,650 --> 00:41:11,970
♪People gather, then part♪

586
00:41:57,070 --> 00:41:58,550
The situation in the capital

587
00:41:58,800 --> 00:42:00,000
is uncertain now.

588
00:42:00,728 --> 00:42:03,510
And Du Cuique is still lurking
in the shadows, waiting for her chance.

589
00:42:04,920 --> 00:42:07,960
Yet I've been ordered
to escort provisions to the capital.

590
00:42:09,510 --> 00:42:10,320
The burden

591
00:42:11,230 --> 00:42:12,480
on your shoulders

592
00:42:13,230 --> 00:42:14,230
is no lighter than mine.

593
00:42:20,070 --> 00:42:21,710
Du Zheng died because of you.

594
00:42:22,150 --> 00:42:23,800
Du Cuique was convicted because of me.

595
00:42:25,150 --> 00:42:26,800
I understand why she wants revenge.

596
00:42:28,070 --> 00:42:29,590
But it's been sixteen years.

597
00:42:30,800 --> 00:42:32,550
Why did she wait until now

598
00:42:33,000 --> 00:42:34,760
when the Retired Emperor
has been captured,

599
00:42:35,150 --> 00:42:36,510
and the capital is under siege?

600
00:42:40,320 --> 00:42:41,110
Could it be

601
00:42:41,960 --> 00:42:43,510
that fortune truly favors the wicked

602
00:42:43,608 --> 00:42:45,320
and handed Du Cuique this opportunity?

603
00:42:48,510 --> 00:42:49,400
You suspect

604
00:42:50,800 --> 00:42:52,670
Du Cuique
deliberately chose this moment?

605
00:42:58,550 --> 00:42:59,190
Your Lordship!

606
00:43:00,110 --> 00:43:00,880
Your Lordship!

607
00:43:05,020 --> 00:43:07,940
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

608
00:43:09,190 --> 00:43:13,670
Strike a man in the face
and attack his sorest point.

609
00:43:15,440 --> 00:43:17,400
Such underhanded tactics

610
00:43:18,030 --> 00:43:19,440
would never occur to someone

611
00:43:19,440 --> 00:43:21,032
of Lin Jinqi's privileged upbringing.

612
00:43:22,110 --> 00:43:24,710
Only that lowly servant Xu Lanxiang

613
00:43:25,280 --> 00:43:27,030
knows what I want

614
00:43:27,030 --> 00:43:28,320
and what I despise.

615
00:43:29,150 --> 00:43:30,550
I'll kill Xu Lanxiang for you

616
00:43:30,670 --> 00:43:33,800
and wash away today's
humiliation with her blood.

617
00:43:37,440 --> 00:43:39,150
This time, I'll do it myself.

618
00:43:42,590 --> 00:43:45,150
I'll kill Xu Lanxiang with my own hands.

619
00:44:01,860 --> 00:44:05,980
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

620
00:44:08,820 --> 00:44:13,340
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

621
00:44:14,620 --> 00:44:18,540
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

622
00:44:19,220 --> 00:44:21,980
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

623
00:44:22,700 --> 00:44:25,020
♪Though all the world may fade♪

624
00:44:25,020 --> 00:44:28,100
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

625
00:44:29,620 --> 00:44:33,860
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

626
00:44:36,780 --> 00:44:40,940
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

627
00:44:42,740 --> 00:44:46,300
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

628
00:44:46,300 --> 00:44:49,860
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

629
00:44:50,660 --> 00:44:56,340
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

630
00:44:56,700 --> 00:45:01,020
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

631
00:45:01,380 --> 00:45:04,340
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

632
00:45:04,340 --> 00:45:08,100
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

633
00:45:08,100 --> 00:45:10,980
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

634
00:45:10,980 --> 00:45:15,060
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

635
00:45:15,060 --> 00:45:18,420
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

636
00:45:18,420 --> 00:45:22,180
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

637
00:45:22,180 --> 00:45:26,180
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

638
00:45:26,940 --> 00:45:31,100
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

639
00:45:31,100 --> 00:45:34,540
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

640
00:45:34,540 --> 00:45:38,180
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

641
00:45:38,180 --> 00:45:41,060
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

642
00:45:41,060 --> 00:45:45,140
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

643
00:45:45,140 --> 00:45:48,500
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

644
00:45:48,500 --> 00:45:52,140
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

645
00:45:52,140 --> 00:45:59,940
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
